function [a|] pointer to pointee:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("add pointer depth", pointee)

function ignore value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("discard", value)

function value as destination:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("cast", value, destination)

function set variable to value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("store", variable, value)

function the address of variable:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("address of", variable)

function the value at pointer:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("dereference", pointer)

class:
    patterns:
        [a|] node
    members:
        next as a pointer to a node

ignore 0 as a pointer to a node
set descendant to @intrinsic("construct", a node, 0 as a pointer to a node)
set child to the address of descendant
ignore the value at child
